*.DS_Store

docs/*

# Full-size sources for the WIP site's derivatives. Every one of these is the
# original a committed web copy was encoded from — keep them locally so a
# derivative can be regenerated, but they are megabytes each and no page ever
# requests them. See "The size budget" in WIP/CLAUDE.md.
*_full.jpg
*_full.png
WIP/img/Intro.mp4